    <data key="d0">Intellect Design Fabric Data Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing data ingestion from multiple sources into a Kubernetes cluster via ELB, using Amazon MQ for decoupling, VPC Peering for MongoDB Atlas access, and RDS/ElastiCache for persistent storage and session caching.</data>
    <data key="d3">Data Processing &amp; Analytics</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
